    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "tending to the crater just feels like watching something rot. it's like last season was the whole show, and now i'm just stuck in the credits, watching the screen go black. it's just empty. there's no more \"new landscape\" to explore because the version of me that could actually experience things is gone. isn't there a point where you just admit the story is over?",
