      "content": "It is a deep and valid feeling to grieve the end of a chapter that felt so defining. That sense of emptiness is real, and it needs acknowledgement, not just a quick fix or a fresh start. Deciding when a story's arc changes is intensely personal, and that doesn't have to mean the entire book is over. Sometimes, the next part of the narrative is about finding a quiet resilience within the stillness.",
